//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// Deity Zenith for Majesty Gold HD - by Bener Kaya.
// ONE bytecode for original Majesty AND Northern Expansion / Freestyle.
// Part 1: Expansion (FM_*, IDTXT_FMX_*). Part 2: original Majesty (FMB_*, IDTXT_FMB_*).
// The 4 stock hooks at the end pick the part at run time (FM_Ruleset_MX).
//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

expression #FM_Type_Count 45
expression #FM_Max_Alive 40
expression #FM_Spawn_Radius 300
expression #FM_Wander_Radius 500
expression #FM_Guard_Range 600
expression #FMB_Type_Count 32
expression #FMB_Max_Alive 40
expression #FMB_Spawn_Radius 300
expression #FMB_Wander_Radius 500
expression #FMB_Guard_Range 600

// ===== Part 1: Expansion / Freestyle =====
////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// Deity Zenith - Northern Expansion / Freestyle rules (MajestyExpansion)
// Overrides by name: explore_flag_birth, RewardFlag_Birth, GplKickoff, attack_flag_birth. The chat cheats are
// not overridden.
////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////


